    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Стака́н, ча́шка, ло́жка, ви́лка, нож, буты́лка.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Нож, ножи́, ноже́й: the stress jumps to the end. And ви́лок, буты́лок, ло́жек: an о or е slips in.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:pe8mr'
    '|a||Сала́т, сок, еда́: salad, juice, food. Коли́чество: the amount. Ро́вно в семь: at seven sharp. And два челове́ка, but пять челове́к.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 14960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1e7s8mv'
    '|a||Ка́тя пи́шет. You know с двух and с пяти́ from lesson 118; now every case.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:a3klhf'
    '|a||Для двадцати́ челове́к: the of-case, teal.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1wvwiak'
    '|a||Двум официа́нтам: the to-case, purple, and the noun goes purple with it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:cf6ho7'
    '|a||С десятью́ гостя́ми: the with-case, blue. Гостя́ми too.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1rfrq80'
    '|a||А я ду́маю о трёх сала́тах. The about-case, orange.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:giu60k'
    '|a||From two up, in these four cases, the noun mostly goes plural, in the number''s case.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:11rguv0'
    '|a||Ско́лько? Два, пять, со́рок.':
