      ms: 3160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1vrqo3i'
    '|a||Для кого́? Для двух, для пяти́, для сорока́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:gb5a94'
    '|a||К кому́? К двум, к пяти́, к сорока́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:158pxd9'
    '|a||С кем? С двумя́, с пятью́, с сорока́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:11fmnps'
    '|a||О ком? О двух, о пяти́, о сорока́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:p797dx'
    '|a||Пять up to три́дцать change like дверь: -и, and -ью in the with-case. Три and четы́ре go like два: трёх, трём, тремя́; четырёх, четырём, четырьмя́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 15760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ii5mw6'
    '|a||Со́рок, девяно́сто and сто: just -а in these four cases. Сорока́, девяно́ста, ста. As the object, пять and со́рок stay; with people, два to четы́ре mostly take the of-form: я ви́жу двух госте́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 21840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1v8fs5j'
    '|a||Пятьдеся́т: both halves change, пяти́десяти. And a long number changes every part: с пятью́десятью двумя́ гостя́ми. Even Russians stumble here: just recognise it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1u20act'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:bg0001'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски: the number''s ending.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1haj8t3'
    '|a||Сок для сорока́ госте́й. Ка́тя пи́шет трём гостя́м.':
